    # Data product / Snapshot
    title: "DeDuCE: Deforestation and carbon emissions due to agriculture and forestry activities from 2001-2022"
    description: |-
      Lookup tables used by the DeDuCE model. They include the list of commodities with their FAOSTAT item codes and commodity groups, and the mapping of Brazilian IBGE crops to those commodities.
    date_published: "2024-08-31"
    version_producer: "1.0.1"
    title_snapshot: "DeDuCE: Deforestation and carbon emissions due to agriculture and forestry activities from 2001-2022 – Commodity lookup tables"

